{"id":"ho_lle","lemma":"Hölle","pos":"noun","rank":446,"glosses":["hell"],"ipa":"/ˈhœlə/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/a/ae/De-at-H%C3%B6lle.ogg/De-at-H%C3%B6lle.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"genitive":"Hölle","plural":"Höllen"},"examples":[{"text":"Krieg ist die Hölle.","en":"War is hell.","words":[{"g":"war, warfare"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"the"},null]},{"text":"Du hast mir das Leben zur Hölle gemacht.","en":"You made my life a living hell.","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"have","l":"haben"},{"g":"(to) me","l":"ich"},{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"a state in which…"},{"g":"to the"},null,{"g":"to make","l":"machen"}]},{"text":"Er starb, und seine Seele fuhr zur Hölle.","en":"He died and his soul went to hell.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"to die","l":"sterben"},{"g":"and"},{"g":"his","l":"seiner"},{"g":"soul"},{"g":"to go at speed","l":"fahren"},{"g":"to the"},null]},{"text":"Ihr habt mir das Leben zur Hölle gemacht.","en":"You made my life a living hell.","words":[{"g":"you (pl.) / her"},{"g":"to have","l":"haben"},{"g":"(to) me","l":"ich"},{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"a state in which…"},{"g":"to the"},null,{"g":"to make","l":"machen"}]},{"text":"Sie haben mir das Leben zur Hölle gemacht.","en":"You made my life a living hell.","words":[{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"have"},{"g":"(to) me","l":"ich"},{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"a state in which…"},{"g":"to the"},null,{"g":"to make","l":"machen"}]}]}